eLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:254635","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"さくらめ","creatorId":"egs:creator:25545","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:25545","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:25545","name":"さくらめ","detail":"グラフィック","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:254636","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"アトリエピーチ","creatorId":"vndb:s5430","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:17101","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5430","name":"アトリエピーチ","detail":"音声制作","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:254637","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"唯々月 たすく","creatorId":"vndb:s3585","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3585","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3585","name":"唯々月 たすく","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:167220","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c91483","characterName":"若弥 紫苑","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77892","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"308964"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22707"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91483"},"originalCharacterName":"若弥 紫苑","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobby: Camera"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Sea creatures, Suiren"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Good at: Military academic, housework"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weaknesses: Men in general, Sergeant Asidaka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger sister of the Wakami sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is cool, beautiful, transcendent, and mature. Also very cautious and a lone wolf. Yet can be emotional around people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Basically a caring and kind-hearted person, though sometimes a bit sharp-tongued."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She tries to hide it, but she has an inferiority complex toward her sister. It rears its ugly head in when a third party compares the two. However, Shion herself is more than capable and resourceful. Shion is very smart, but Suiren's intelligence level is ridiculous."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She buys a DSLR with the money she earns from her part-time job and names it \"Marumie-kun\". She just dotes on it. Only when looking into it, she can let her burden go and be honest with herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is firm and precise, and has a very serious personality, but she is essentially timid and clumsy. From an early age, she has been very brilliant and able."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Surrounded by comparison with Suiren, who always gets more favours, she felt that there was no one who could see her as who she is. She grows less interested in others, building walls with the outside world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91483"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若弥姉妹の妹。クールな美少女で超然としており、大人びた印象を与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に警戒心が強く、ほとんど他人を寄せ付けないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気を許した相手の前では感情的な姿も見せてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あえて刺さる言葉を使用する事もあるが基本的には面倒見が良く優しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀すぎる姉へのコンプレックスがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コンプレックスは日常生活においては出てこないが、主に第三者から比較された時に不機嫌そうな態度という形で現れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、紫苑自身も十二分に優秀で才気にも満ちている。比較対象の水蓮がおかしいだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コテージのアルバイトで稼いだお金でデジタル一眼レフを買い、「まるみえくん」と名づけ溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これを覗き込んでいる時だけ心の枷が外れて素直になれる自分を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者で几帳面、至って真面目な性格だが、本質的には臆病で不器用。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から優秀すぎるほどに優秀で、なんでも出来て、周りからも持て囃されてきた水蓮と比較されることが多かったせいで、自分自身を見てくれる人なんていない、というような思いがあり、他人に対して興味が薄く、壁を作り、踏み込むことも、踏み込ませることもないようにしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22707","sourceWorkId":"29728","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若弥姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールな美人で超然としており、大人びた印象を与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に警戒心が強く、ほとんど他人を寄せ付けないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気を許した相手の前では感情的な姿も見せてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あえて刺さる言葉を使用する事もあるが基本的には面倒見が良く優しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀すぎる姉へのコンプレックスがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コンプレックスは日常生活においては出てこないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主に第三者から比較された時に不機嫌そうな態度という形で現れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、紫苑自身も十二分に優秀で才気にも満ちている。比較対象の水蓮がおかしいだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コテージのアルバイトで稼いだお金でデジタル一眼レフを買い、「まるみえくん」と名づけ溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これを覗き込んでいる時だけ心の枷が外れて素直になれる自分を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者で几帳面、至って真面目な性格だが、本質的には臆病で不器用。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からその優秀すぎるほどに優秀で、なんでも出来て、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りからも持て囃されてきた水蓮と比較されることが多かったせいで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分自身を見てくれる人なんていない、というような思いがあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人に対して興味が薄く、壁を作り、踏み込むことも、踏み込ませることもないようにしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77892"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77892","value":"海の生き物、姉"},{"label":"苦手","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77892","value":"男全般、アシダカ軍曹"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77892","value":"カメラ"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea490e502c184b38f529d08873675eb835f7a464756c7071f34aabdcfec90f40.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7941ca8f7453c87cd48acb73dd0cf44ff888eb7872800689648fc47309720ac.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎真実","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:308964:77892:8165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91484","characterName":"若弥 水蓮","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77891","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"308964"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22706"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91484"},"originalCharacterName":"若弥 水蓮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interests: Observing people"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite: Diving"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strengths: Lip-reading, profiling, looking after others"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weaknesses: Machinery and web infrastructure"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The elder sister of the two. Has an angelic face with devilishly mature femininity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her natural empathy and outstanding observation, she can understand what the other wants right away. And in a way, her genuine kindness makes it easy for her to fulfill it. Therefore, when one starts to indulge in her favor, he usually ends up being a deadweight. Incidentally, she enjoys spoiling people like that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a bit sloppy when working with machines, but for physique, study, housework, appearance, and professional work, she is just perfect. A nature born prodigy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is equally kind to everyone. On the other hand, she can think on her own feet. She developed a transcendental detachment such that extreme feelings like anger and jealousy never occur to her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91484"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若弥姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使の顔をした悪魔の様なオトナの女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"持って生まれた共感力、並外れた観察眼で人が今何を求めているのかが手に取るように分かる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてある意味純粋な優しさによりそれを容易く叶えてしまうので彼女の好意に甘えだすと大概は駄目人間になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに彼女は人を駄目人間にするのを潜在的に楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械に弱いという弱点はあるが、運動、勉強、家事、美貌、仕事、どこをとっても満点をとってしまう。ナチュラルボーン天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、本人に貪欲さが無いので才能は休眠状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても区別も差別もなく、平等に優しさを向けられるなど、穏やかで心優しく、包み込むような包容力のある世話焼きな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、他人に影響を受けることはほとんどなく、自己が完全に確立した超絶マイペースさを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは嫉妬や怒りといったマイナスのネガティブ感情とは無縁なほど。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22706","sourceWorkId":"29728","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若弥姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使の顔をした悪魔の様なオトナの女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"持って生まれた共感力、並外れた観察眼で人が今何を求めているのかが手に取るように分かる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてある意味純粋な優しさによりそれを容易く叶えてしまうので彼女の好意に甘えだすと大概は駄目人間になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに彼女は人を駄目人間にするのを潜在的に楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械に弱いという弱点はあるが、運動、勉強、家事、美貌、仕事、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこをとっても満点をとってしまう。ナチュラルボーン天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、本人に貪欲さが無いので才能は休眠状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても区別も差別もなく、平等に優しさを向けられるなど、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで心優しく、包み込むような包容力のある世話焼きな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、他人に影響を受けることはほとんどなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自己が完全に確立した超絶マイペースさを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは嫉妬や怒りといったマイナスのネガティブ感情とは無縁なほど。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77891"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77891","value":"ダイビング"},{"label":"苦手","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77891","value":"機械、WEBインフラ"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77891","value":"人間観察"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b66fab1693b1f3631b3a9f1f6e277b255935f39e757dd8ebad5abbcdb54ce4c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5f9944e45e05d03e1d30e3b6e771977c8b981ade3aa0fe0b22224054bcacd93.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:308964:77891:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:2780","sou